Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.30,H_id,,0,0,0,,Setelah mati sekali, aku tidak punya batas lagi.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.30,C_id,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episode GRATIS ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.98,S_id,,0,0,0,,Mengambil penggemar bestie sendiri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:04.98,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kedengarannya tanpa prinsip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:08.21,S_id,,0,0,0,,Tapi setelah mati sekali,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:12.24,S_id,,0,0,0,,prinsip jadi hal paling murah bagiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:14.24,S_id,,0,0,0,,Song Jingyi tak pernah kekurangan penggemar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:16.24,S_id,,0,0,0,,Ganteng, kekar, kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:18.24,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bahkan yang bisa bantu studinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:20.24,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kamu pikir mudah membuatnya terkesan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.24,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:23.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,Sekalipun Jingyi tak memilihku,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.31,0:00:24.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,bukan kamu yang berhak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:25.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kukira kamu jelek saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:27.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,Ternyata tidak tahu malu juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:28.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku tak tahu malu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:29.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kita sama-sama di jurusan olahraga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.31,0:00:30.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,Anda tahu aku sahabat Jingyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:31.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,kamu pura-pura peduli padaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.31,0:00:32.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,memberi sinyal bias,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.31,0:00:34.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,demi mendekati Jingyi lewat aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:35.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,Jadi siapa pakai siapa duluan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.31,0:00:36.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,Mi Ke kelihatannya bodoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.31,0:00:38.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,tapi dia bisa membaca niatku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.31,0:00:39.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:40.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,Jiang Muyi.
